    "Official site icons are snapshots; remote URLs and hashed asset paths can change.",
    "The same local file is intentionally reused for source entries that resolve to the same website favicon (Plymouth LibGuides pages and the two Met Office entries).",
    "Validation records the detected payload format, dimensions, byte length, and SHA-256. A few upstream .ico URLs actually serve PNG data, so their local extension is corrected to .png.",
